# Normalize to LF in the repo; check out native. PowerShell and VBScript keep
# CRLF on disk — a .ps1 with non-ASCII content run under Windows PowerShell 5.1
# needs a BOM and CRLF or it dies with misleading parse errors.
* text=auto
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.html text eol=lf
